      "title": "Beginner full-body, 3 days",
      "goal_text": "Goal: learn movements, build general strength and muscle. Mon/Wed/Fri; 45–60 min; 6–8 weeks.",
      "schedule_text": "Each session: leg press or goblet squat 2×8–12; machine chest press or incline push-up 2×8–12; seated row 2×8–12; DB RDL 2×8–10; pulldown 2×8–12; dead bug 2×6–10/side. RIR 2–4; rest 1–3 min. Add 1–2 easy walks as desired.",
      "progression_guardrail_text": "Progression / guardrail: Progress reps first, then small load increase when technique and target RIR are stable. Keep first two weeks deliberately conservative.",
